      "message": "I think someone mentioned they wanted it in passing or similar. Maybe ccross wanted it?\n\nI did not know Java build very well in 2017. Would argue against having this now - Android has a Java dependency nightmare because everything is in or depends on frameworks.jar. Having library sectioned off from Android build/without dependencies, well, we should strive for that much more often.",
